<title>CHINA: HSBC Americas 1997 H1 net up 32 pct.</title>
<headline>HSBC Americas 1997 H1 net up 32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million of U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Loan loss provision	 39.40    vs    34.75</p>
<p>    Pretax income		335.11    vs   262.54</p>
<p>    Net income		   230.61    vs   175.04</p>
<p>    Total liabilities	  30,771    vs   20,888</p>
<p>    Total assets		 32,873    vs   22,727</p>
<p>Note - Full name of the U.S. subidiary of HSBC Holdings Plc is HSBC Americas Inc.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
